return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-25T19:15:51+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-25T19:15:51+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'将此 WordPress 网站（文件和数据库）打包为一个可供 Zinn Digital® 导入的压缩包，适用于我们无法以其他方式访问的主机。将其安装在您即将离开的网站上，按一下按钮，然后将链接粘贴到您的 Zinn® 迁移中。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'将此网站迁移至 Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'迁移至 Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'您没有执行此操作的权限。','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'此功能将本网站上的所有内容（包括文件和数据库）打包成一个压缩包，并为您生成一个专属私密链接。将该链接粘贴到您在 Zinn® 上的迁移工具中，我们便会帮您将网站迁移过来。在您选择分享该链接之前，此处的任何内容都不会发送到任何地方。','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'您可能不需要这个。如果您的旧主机提供 FTP、SSH、cPanel、Plesk 或 DirectAdmin，Zinn® 可以使用这些详细信息直接获取网站，您可以完全跳过此插件——这样速度更快，且事后不会留下任何东西。当这些都不可用时，请使用此插件。','Room on this server'=>'本服务器剩余空间','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'此服务器无法告知我们剩余多少磁盘空间，因此我们无法为您检查。该软件包大约需要 %s。如果您不确定是否有足够的空间，请在构建前向您的主机商咨询——中途耗尽空间的服务器会导致站点瘫痪。','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'该套餐大约需要 %1$s，而此服务器有 %2$s 可用空间。','Build the package'=>'构建软件包','Building…'=>'正在构建…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'正在打包：%1$s。已处理 %2$s 个文件，已写入 %3$s 个。','your files'=>'您的文件','your database'=>'您的数据库','Continue'=>'继续','Cancel and delete'=>'取消并删除','Your package is ready'=>'您的套餐已就绪','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'复制此链接并将其粘贴到您在 Zinn® 上的迁移中：','Size: %s.'=>'大小：%s。','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'请像对待密码一样对待此链接。任何拥有该链接的人都可以下载您的整个网站，包括您的数据库。我们在打包完成后 24 小时会自动删除该文件 — 您的迁移完成后，请立即自行将其删除。','Delete the package now'=>'立即删除套餐','Build it again'=>'重新构建','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'此服务器没有安装 PHP 的 ZipArchive 扩展，因此我们无法在此处生成压缩包。请联系您的主机商启用该扩展，或者改用 Zinn® 上的迁移表单并提供您的 FTP 或 SSH 详细信息。','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'无法在您的上传目录中创建文件夹，因此找不到写入软件包的位置。请检查 wp-content/uploads 是否具有写入权限。','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'当前没有正在构建的软件包。请先开始一个。','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'无法以写入模式打开包文件。','We could not write the database export.'=>'无法写入数据库导出文件。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读 %s 用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® WordPress 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及为管理多个网站的人群打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟网站、域名和外链，资金安全托管，直至双方满意。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的人','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作家、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目并让他们竞标。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'查看 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，因而未被安装。']];